'''''Poet, Speak of the Sky Through Me (I)''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[The Fall at Dawn's Rise]].

==Steps==
# Head to the "Demigod Council" Dawncloud and continue your adventure
# Head to the "Fortress of Dome" Eye of Twilight and continue your adventure
# Continue onward and explore Eye of Twilight
# Try to illuminate the celestial mural
# Read through past memories and search for clues
# Sort through the clues you've collected
# Use the celestial globe to activate the celestial mural
# Use the West Wind Compass to set up a path
# Follow the mythical beast and continue forward
# Take the elevator and continue forward
# Check on Solabis' condition
# Continue onward and explore Eye of Twilight
# Try to control the wind field to reach the celestial globe's location
# Try to repair the "circuits"
# Try to repair the "circuits" on the other side
# Use the celestial globe to alter the weather and force the Titan to reveal themself
# Witness the truth about Seliose
# Continue forward and track down Aquila
# Head to the West Wind Compass
# Use the West Wind Compass to create a path
# Continue forward and keep up with Lunabis
# Continue forward and track down Aquila
# Use the shrine to enhance prayers
# Head to the celestial globe's location
# Defeat the Black Tide Creatures
# Use the Punch ability of the Hand of Zagreus to repair the "hard drive"
# Use the celestial globe to alter the firmament again and force the Titan to reveal themself
# Read through memories to reveal the hidden truths of the past
# Continue forward and join up with Solabis
# Continue forward and track down Aquila
# Use the West Wind Compass to rebuild the path
# Continue forward and track down Aquila
# Use the celestial globe to alter the firmament and reveal the past.

