:'''Hyacine:''' Then... that corrupted being before us must be Lord Solabis.
:'''Hyacine:''' Did you lead us here so we can free your companion?
:'''Lunabis:''' *shrieking*
:'''Hyacine:''' ...I understand now.
:'''Solabis:''' *roaring*
:'''Hyacine:''' You must have been tormented by pain for so long. But you didn't give up, and you've held on to what little is left of your will with such tenacity.
:'''Hyacine:''' Don't be afraid. You're not alone anymore. I am Hyacinthia, the healer who inherited the hero's bloodline...
:'''Hyacine:''' ...Seliose the Daythunder Knight was once your comrade, wasn't she?
:'''Solabis:''' *roaring*
:'''Hyacine:''' Lord Solabis, your body has been completely corroded by the black tide. But I can still... heal your tenacious soul. Just like Lady Lunabis &mdash; even if you've lost your mortal body, your spirit remains pure.
:'''Hyacine:''' Please keep holding on to what's left of your will. And I will... reawaken you as a heroic soul.
:'''Solabis:''' *roaring*
