:'''Phainon:''' It's over...
:'''Lunabis:''' Solabis...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Hold your horses, you're actually speaking!
::'''Mem:''' No need to be surprised. After all, this is a world where even a pink puppy can speak...
::'''Mem:''' Ugh, I can't believe I'm calling myself that now too!
::Hello, Sister Pegasus.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Hello, Sister Pegasus.
:'''Mem:''' So she speaks!
:'''Lunabis:''' Solabis... You're finally awake.
:'''Solabis:''' *roaring*
:'''Solabis:''' My consciousness has been lost for far too long. Finally, I have been released from the black tide's cage.
:'''Solabis:''' Little girl... Are you Seliose's descendant?
:'''Hyacine:''' It is me, Lord Solabis. My name is Hyacinthia, and my companions call me Hyacine.
:'''Solabis:''' Hyacinthia &mdash; you don't have the scent of her on you.
:'''Hyacine:''' It's been a thousand years. Seliose's blood may have thinned in my veins, but the resolve of the Sky people has never been eroded by time. I've journeyed here to fulfill her dying wish.
:'''Solabis:''' How much do you know about her dying wish?
:'''Hyacine:''' I know that... in order to support the shattered sky, she merged herself with the divine body of the Titan.
:'''Hyacine:''' And I also know that she left behind a message, calling on future generations to one day ascend to the heavens again and reclaim the Coreflame of Aquila.
:'''Solabis:''' ...Has the legend changed so much since your people fell to the earth?
:'''Solabis:''' Girl, you said you're a doctor?
:'''Solabis:''' You only know how to heal and tend to wounds... With such a weak lot in life, how do you plan to challenge the embodiment of the heavens?
:'''Phainon:''' With this long sword, heroic soul.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} And my bat!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} And his spear!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} And their... pink love!
:'''Phainon:''' As you can see, we are all Hyacinthia's companions and comrades.
:'''Phainon:''' You've already witnessed our combined strength.
:'''Solabis:''' ...It's not bad, but still lacking compared to her.
:'''Lunabis:''' Solabis, let go of your ego and accept their kindness.
:'''Lunabis:''' You've been trapped in time by the black tide, while great change has spread over the world. If I'm not mistaken, the God of War Nikador also fell to the hands of these warriors.
:'''Phainon:''' We've laid all the other Titans to rest, one by one. Now, the final target for the Flame-Chase is the master of this sky fortress.
:'''Phainon:''' Please guide us to an audience with Aquila, heroic souls. Seliose initiated the era of slaying gods and attaining their flames. Even if she could not witness the end of this era, you will all at least bear witness on her behalf.
:'''Solabis:''' Confidence and fierceness &mdash; Yes, I do indeed see a shadow of her in you.
:'''Hyacine:''' Aquila's mark... flew away?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Did they sense something?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is that a reaction... from the Titan?
:'''Solabis:''' Maybe they detected our awakening.
